  "save": {
    "mismatches": [],
    "confirmed": [
      "The proposal passes DocumentService and the workbench context into the single workspace-session facade; load and commit delegate to Documents and WorkspaceLoads.",
      "StudioSave forwards captures, disk, signal, synchronous ownership check, wholeWorkspace and excludedPaths unchanged to workspaceSession.save.",
      "Per-document SaveAs targets retain captured document/model ownership and do not become the workspace target.",
      "loadRecord returns the owned prepared record; ensureSource adopts it through DocumentService without reading its compatibility text getter.",
      "Provider save reconciliation retains committed physical baselines and preserves newly edited source revisions."
    ],
